    "description": "<p>Once per rest, you and an ally in Far range may both <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to synchronize your thoughts. Until the end of the scene or one of you mark their last Hit Point, you two gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li>You and the ally gain access to level 3 or lower domain cards from either loadout. If a card requires a Spellcast Roll, it uses your Spellcast trait.</li><li>It costs 2 Hope to initiate a Tag Team Roll with each other.</li><li>Once for the duration of the spell, when one rolls a critical success, you may both gain a Hope and clear a Stress.</li></ul>",
